        "description": "Guild houses, church spires, a long lakeside promenade and chocolate shops.",
        "details": "Zurich old town is on both sides of the Limmat river, with the Grossmunster, Fraumunster and Lindenhof viewpoint. Swimming spots on the lake and river are popular in summer. Bahnhofstrasse is a famous shopping street. Zurich is expensive, so book ahead.",
