        "description": "A covered wooden bridge, a lakeside old town and a cable-car and cogwheel trip up Pilatus.",
        "details": "The Kapellbrucke is the symbol of Lucerne. Boats cross Lake Lucerne, and Mount Pilatus is reached by the steepest cogwheel railway in the world and cable cars. Rigi is the other classic mountain. Views depend on clear weather.",
