        "details": "Interlaken sits between Lake Thun and Lake Brienz. The Lauterbrunnen valley has the Staubbach Falls and Trummelbach Falls inside a mountain, and Wengen and Murren are car-free villages. Adventure options include paragliding and canyoning.",
