        "description": "A car-free village below the Matterhorn, with a cogwheel train to a panoramic ridge.",
        "details": "Zermatt is car-free, with electric taxis. The Gornergrat railway climbs to 3,089 metres for views of the Matterhorn and 29 peaks over 4,000 metres. Rothorn paradise has a hiking trail and picnic. Clear mornings give the best views.",
